      "body": "### 🔗 Linked issue\n\n### 📚 Description\n\nin nuxt v5, only top-level files in `server/utils/` are scanned, just like in `app/utils/`. this is a breaking change from nuxt v4 (where nitropack had different behaviour).\n\nthis adds detection of used auto-imports from nested directories, and disables this behaviour with `nitroLegacy.imports`",
